  "scope": "Every odd n>=1: original named-leaf bijection, typed CG CDC/model graph isomorphism, all adjacency and deck intertwining. Actual connected bipartite model and original CDC, actual strong decks, original deck fold recovery and instantiated full-automorphism fold/conjugacy equivalence. Symbolic six-cycle characterization for the model at n>=2 and original CDC at odd n>=3; arbitrary actual automorphisms preserve centre, leaf and ring types; explicit n=1 exception. Synchronized actual ring actions, uniqueness from cyclic index/direction/swap and an injective encoding of all original CDC automorphisms into Fin(24*n) at every odd n>=3. No full group classification or exact cousin-count Lean theorem.",
